WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.641
Cora frowned. "No way!

2
00:00:04.642 --> 00:00:08.852
The jellyfish can't hunt for our plankton.

3
00:00:08.853 --> 00:00:11.690
We will stop them!"

4
00:00:11.691 --> 00:00:15.228
"But what can we do?" Mo said.

5
00:00:15.229 --> 00:00:20.887
"The jellyfish are everywhere—and they sting!"

6
00:00:20.888 --> 00:00:35.061
"Let's go back to the compass shell," Cora said.

7
00:00:35.062 --> 00:00:41.832
Cora sprayed the shell with ink.

8
00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:45.033
The shell opened.

9
00:00:45.034 --> 00:00:49.956
In the top was a picture of glowing lights.

10
00:00:49.957 --> 00:00:55.465
"Watch out, Cora!" Mo looked around for jellyfish.

11
00:00:55.466 --> 00:00:58.719
"Remember? Jellyfish like lights!"

12
00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:03.065
Just then the arrow spun and flew off.

13
00:01:03.066 --> 00:01:10.022
"Come on!" Cora said. "Let's follow it!"

14
00:01:10.023 --> 00:01:15.256
They swam after the arrow.

15
00:01:15.257 --> 00:01:24.145
It dove deep into the water.

16
00:01:24.146 --> 00:01:30.570
"Look!" Cora saw something in the darkness.

17
00:01:30.571 --> 00:01:34.685
"A shipwreck!"

18
00:01:34.686 --> 00:01:38.571
They swam around the old ship.

19
00:01:38.572 --> 00:01:43.191
It had broken boards and old windows.

20
00:01:43.192 --> 00:01:49.173
Mo swam slowly. "This ship is spooky."

21
00:01:49.174 --> 00:01:58.358
Cora nodded. "Why did the arrow bring us here?"

22
00:01:58.359 --> 00:02:04.536
They followed the arrow into a room.

23
00:02:04.537 --> 00:02:07.321
It pointed at something.

24
00:02:07.322 --> 00:02:11.792
Cora swam over and grabbed the object.

25
00:02:11.793 --> 00:02:17.560
"How strange," she said. "It's an old lantern."

26
00:02:17.561 --> 00:02:21.414
Mo frowned. "An old lantern?

27
00:02:21.415 --> 00:02:24.915
That won't get rid of the jellyfish!"

